0001481E                            ; Subroutine called at the peak of a jump that transforms Sonic into Super Sonic
0001481E                            ; if he has enough rings and emeralds
0001481E                            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
0001481E                            
0001481E                            ; ||||||||||||||| S U B R O U T I N E |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
